      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 4.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.29,
      "end_seconds": 10.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "tell me what's brought you in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.46,
      "end_seconds": 13.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "I've been wanting contraception"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.71,
      "end_seconds": 18.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly including from the the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.41,
      "end_seconds": 23.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.12,
      "end_seconds": 27.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.67,
      "end_seconds": 29.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.09,
      "end_seconds": 34.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "What's the timeline when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.53,
      "end_seconds": 39.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I've had it for about two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.74,
      "end_seconds": 43.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.7,
      "end_seconds": 49.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "about a a five out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.67,
      "end_seconds": 55.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "so, any slightly heavy periods as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.89,
      "end_seconds": 58.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "yes, actually"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.97,
      "end_seconds": 66.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any migraine with aura or breast lumps?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.95,
      "end_seconds": 70.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.42,
      "end_seconds": 73.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "did you notice any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.84,
      "end_seconds": 77.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "no, no smoking"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.39,
      "end_seconds": 82.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "On the cardiac side anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.13,
      "end_seconds": 86.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.6,
      "end_seconds": 89.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.48,
      "end_seconds": 92.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.93,
      "end_seconds": 113.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.5,
      "end_seconds": 121.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "yes I had a caesarean for my second baby nine years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.93,
      "end_seconds": 129.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.7,
      "end_seconds": 151.55,
      "duration_seconds": 20.85,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.94,
      "end_seconds": 155.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.62,
      "end_seconds": 161.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I have anxiety for about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.13,
      "end_seconds": 170.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "right, so so anxiety is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.92,
      "end_seconds": 184.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.23,
      "end_seconds": 198.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.79,
      "end_seconds": 216.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.54,
      "text": "okay: pulse is 79 beats a minute, blood pressure 118 over 79, SpO2 98 percent on room air"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.06,
      "end_seconds": 221.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "right, let's have a proper look at you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.67,
      "end_seconds": 223.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.9,
      "end_seconds": 243.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.49,
      "end_seconds": 250.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Okay that's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.59,
      "end_seconds": 269.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "okay so my impression is this: The most likely explanation is suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.59,
      "end_seconds": 274.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "ah I'm scared it's something bad is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.05,
      "end_seconds": 313.79,
      "duration_seconds": 37.74,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors. I'll start you on levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. You take it by mouth. That's for contraception. Take the pill at the same time each day and use condoms if you miss two. Please don't wait if you get leg swelling or severe headaches. That's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.34,
      "end_seconds": 317.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Let's review you in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 318.94,
      "end_seconds": 322.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I can put that appointment in for you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.12,
      "end_seconds": 326.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.63,
      "end_seconds": 331.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Okay, that that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
